---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<footer class="bg-[#1C2530] border-t border-[#3B4C60]/40 text-[#DEDEDE] py-16">
  <Container size="wide">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12">
      <!-- Coluna 1: Identidade -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#044A82] flex items-center justify-center font-ruda font-black text-white text-xl border border-[#C1BDA6]/40">
            ✝
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-ruda font-black text-lg tracking-wider text-white uppercase leading-none">Pure Life</span>
            <span class="font-montserrat text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C1BDA6] uppercase mt-0.5">Ministries Brasil</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="font-editorial text-[#C1BDA6] text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">
          "Pois esta é a vontade de Deus: a vossa santificação."
        </p>
        <p class="font-montserrat text-[#DEDEDE] text-xs leading-relaxed">
          Fundado em 1986 por Steve Gallagher, o Pure Life Ministries dedica-se a guiar homens e famílias à vitória bíblica permanente sobre a escravidão sexual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 2: Navegação -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#C1BDA6] mb-5">
          Navegação
        </h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-montserrat text-xs text-[#DEDEDE]">
          <li><a href="/sobre/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Sobre o Ministério</a></li>
          <li><a href="/programas/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Todos os Programas</a></li>
          <li><a href="/programas/residencial/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Programa Residencial</a></li>
          <li><a href="/campus/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Campus em Goiás</a></li>
          <li><a href="/perguntas-frequentes/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Perguntas Frequentes</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 3: Ministério -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#C1BDA6] mb-5">
          Ministério e Mídia
        </h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-montserrat text-xs text-[#DEDEDE]">
          <li><a href="/conferencia/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Conferência Nacional</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editora/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Editora e Livros</a></li>
          <li><a href="/viagem-eua/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Viagem à Sede EUA</a></li>
          <li><a href="/doar/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Apoie este Ministério</a></li>
          <li><a href="/triagem/" class="text-[#C1BDA6] font-bold hover:underline">Pedir Ajuda Confidencial</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna 4: Contato -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-montserrat font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#C1BDA6] mb-5">
          Contato & Localização
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-montserrat text-xs text-[#DEDEDE]">
          <p>Águas Lindas de Goiás - GO</p>
          <p>contato@purelifebrasil.org</p>
          <p>Atendimento Pastoral Confidencial</p>
          <div class="mt-3">
            <a href="/contato/" class="btn-outline-light text-xs py-2 px-4 inline-block">
              Fale Conosco
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra Inferior -->
    <div class="border-t border-[#3B4C60]/40 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 font-montserrat text-xs text-[#DEDEDE]">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Pure Life Ministries Brasil. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-[#C1BDA6]">
        <a href="/perguntas-frequentes/" class="hover:underline">Dúvidas</a>
        <a href="/contato/" class="hover:underline">Atendimento</a>
        <span class="font-editorial text-xs italic tracking-wider text-white">Soli Deo Gloria</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</footer>
